# Answer key: pg921-images-3.epub  (De Profundis, Oscar Wilde)
#
# Line numbers refer to the extracted text stream, not the EPUB markup.
# Reproduce with: python -m corpusprep inspect tests/fixtures/pg921-images-3.epub
#
# The judgement worth stating: lines 18-21 are a transcriber's credit sitting
# AFTER the START marker. They name pglaf.org but never say "gutenberg", which
# is what made them slip through an earlier version. They are publisher
# apparatus rather than authorial text.
#
# Line 23 is the work's title. De Profundis is a single continuous letter with
# no chapter divisions, so the whole body is one region.

1-17      pg_header      Gutenberg header, metadata, START marker
18-21     pg_header      Transcriber credit, after the START marker
23        front_matter   DE PROFUNDIS, title
25-1678   body           The letter, unbroken
1680-1975 pg_licence     END marker and licence text
